---

### 2. Root `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
backend/.env
backend/.env.*
*.pem
*.key
*.crt

# Local Docker overrides & local nginx config
docker-compose.override.yml
frontend/nginx.local.conf

# Runtime storage, vector indexes, uploads & cache
backend/storage/
storage/
faiss_index/
bm25_docs.pkl
indexed_docs.json
uploads/
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/

# Node & Vite build artifacts
frontend/node_modules/
frontend/dist/
frontend/.vite/
*.log

# OS & editor files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
!.vscode/settings.json